Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.53,0:03:00.74,OPCN,,26,0,48,,{\c&H000000&\1a&H96&\blur2}无论过去现在 我依然是我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.74,0:03:04.12,OPCN,,26,0,48,,{\c&H000000&\1a&H96&\blur2}纵使明天错漏百出
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.12,0:03:06.75,OPCN,,26,0,48,,{\c&H000000&\1a&H96&\blur2}那段想要拥入怀抱的旅途
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.75,0:03:11.75,OPCN,,26,0,48,,{\c&H000000&\1a&H96&\blur2}依然全属于我 将我构筑而成
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.75,0:03:13.50,OPCN,,26,0,48,,{\c&H000000&\1a&H96&\blur2}拼凑而成的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.50,0:03:17.63,OPCN,,26,0,48,,{\c&H000000&\1a&H96&\blur2}为何你却仍能感到新鲜（将我构筑而成）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.63,0:03:21.05,OPCN,,26,0,48,,{\c&H000000&\1a&H96&\blur2}理智与疯狂本是一体
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.05,0:03:23.68,OPCN,,26,0,48,,{\c&H000000&\1a&H96&\blur2}如何呈现始终由你决定
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.68,0:03:25.97,OPCN,,26,0,48,,{\c&H000000&\1a&H96&\blur2}唯你一人…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.72,0:22:08.76,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}When I get you sweet and sour
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.35,0:22:11.81,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}That you second send an hours
