Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.65,0:22:26.36,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}When did it change It used to be so green
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.91,0:22:28.78,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}Now turned to blue
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.28,0:22:31.24,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.83,0:22:35.33,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}Little bed of leaves
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.96,0:22:42.17,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}You hand on why Do you leave me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.72,0:22:47.89,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}Grains of sand
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.43,0:22:51.64,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}Fall through my hand
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.64,0:22:54.60,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}Trying to understand
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.81,0:22:58.40,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}Blue like the ******clues
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.40,0:22:59.94,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}Blue like the ocean that I'm drowning in
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.94,0:23:01.48,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}Blue like gaba shoes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.48,0:23:03.03,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}Blue like a thing that the way and
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.03,0:23:04.61,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}then that brought me to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.61,0:23:06.20,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}Blue like a berry juice
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.20,0:23:07.78,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}Blue like my very mood
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.66,0:23:12.79,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}Now where did you go
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.79,0:23:15.96,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}I used to know you better
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.50,0:23:21.59,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}Where did you go
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.72,0:22:08.76,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}当我尝到你的酸涩与甘甜
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.35,0:22:11.81,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}你却选择拉长每一个瞬间
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.81,0:22:16.35,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}你怎能如此漠然
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.40,0:22:21.19,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}何时色彩离开了你的双眼
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.65,0:22:26.36,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}何时瞳中的新绿开始消散
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.91,0:22:28.78,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}只剩下一片幽蓝
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.28,0:22:31.24,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}幽深的蓝
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.83,0:22:35.33,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}落叶织就的床沿
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.96,0:22:42.17,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}你为何偏偏要离开我身边？
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.72,0:22:47.89,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}沙粒一点一点
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.43,0:22:51.64,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}溜出我的指间
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.64,0:22:54.60,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}我努力去分辨
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.81,0:22:58.40,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}幽蓝 像未解的谜团
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.40,0:22:59.94,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}幽蓝 像我坠入的海渊
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.94,0:23:01.48,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}幽蓝 像旧靴的鞋面
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.48,0:23:03.03,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}幽蓝 像命运牵起的线
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.03,0:23:04.61,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}带我来到你身边
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.61,0:23:06.20,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}幽蓝 像浆果汁一般
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.20,0:23:07.78,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}是我心底的怅然
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.66,0:23:12.79,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}如今你究竟去了哪边
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.79,0:23:15.96,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}明明曾与你心意相连
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.50,0:23:21.59,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}你究竟去了哪边
